    "description": "edfcore is a zero-dependency TypeScript library for reading EDF, EDF+, BDF, and BDF+ physiological recordings in browser and Node.js applications. It provides programmatic access to biosignal samples, channel metadata, per-channel sampling rates, physical units, annotations, and discontinuous recording timelines.",
